web.description:
# TwelveLabs video understanding models are now available in Amazon Bedrock
Let’s take a look at the [Marengo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LWUh5wDUzAY) and [Pegasus](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XQDlLnCC_8M) videos that TwelveLabs has published.

```json
{
    "modelId": "twelvelabs.marengo-embed-2-7-v1:0",
    "modelInput": {
        "inputType": "video",
        "mediaSource": {
            "s3Location": {
                "uri": "s3://your-video-object-s3-path",
                "bucketOwner": "your-video-object-s3-bucket-owner-account"
            }
        }
    },
    "outputDataConfig": {
        "s3OutputDataConfig": {
            "s3Uri": "s3://your-bucket-name"
        }
    }
}
```

```json
{
    "embedding": [0.345, -0.678, 0.901, ...],
    "embeddingOption": "visual-text",
    "startSec": 0.0,
    "endSec": 5.0
}
```
